WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.867
Drag a node to a new position

2
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:11.000
Open View controls to find Moved, Reset, and Undo

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Click Moved to select the node you dragged

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.133
Click Reset to restore its original position

5
00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:28.467
Click Undo to return to the dragged position
